      "name": "ccg_classifier.py",
      "filePath": "neuropy/analyses/ccg_classifier.py",
      "summary": "CCG 形状分类层：提供三套互补的 classifier —— 基于手工特征的 CCGClassifier、基于降维嵌入的 CCGClusterClassifier，以及基于模板打分的 CCGTemplateClassifier —— 用于把 cross-correlogram 归入 monosynaptic connection types。",
      "tags": ["classification", "machine-learning", "ccg", "feature-extraction", "analysis"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Uses dataclasses (ClassifyResult, PeakRule, GroupTemplate) as typed records, plus a custom json.JSONEncoder subclass (_NumpyEncoder) to serialize numpy scalars/arrays when persisting templates and snapshots."
